# Documentation — auto-generated test cases, specs, and local-only docs
# Allow-checked-in engineering docs (strategy, CI setup, backlog-of-records).
# `docs/local-only/` stays ignored (contains real BE secret material).
# Generate-on-the-fly artifacts in docs/BACKEND_REQUESTS.md, docs/test_cases.xlsx,
# docs/test-failure-log.md MUST NOT be committed — see ! rules below.
# docs/* keeps the directory traversable for explicit checked-in engineering docs.
docs/*
docs/BACKEND_REQUESTS.md
docs/test_cases.xlsx
docs/test-failure-log.md
docs/local-only/
secrets/
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.*.local.json

# Un-ignore the agent-test-strategy-github-ci deliverables so they ship with the repo
!docs/TESTING_STRATEGY.md
!docs/GITHUB_CI_SETUP.md
!docs/ORCID_OPENALEX_SWAGGER_CONTRACT.md
!docs/ARCHIVE_DUSK_UI_AUDIT.md
!docs/ARCHIVE_DUSK_DESIGN_SYSTEM.md
!docs/ARCHIVE_DUSK_FINAL_CRITIQUE.md
!docs/LECTURER_RESEARCH_WORKFLOW_API_AUDIT.md
!docs/LECTURER_RESEARCH_WORKFLOW_PLAN.md
!docs/LECTURER_RESEARCH_WORKFLOW_DECISIONS.md
!docs/LECTURER_RESEARCH_WORKFLOW_FILE_OWNERSHIP.md
!docs/LECTURER_RESEARCH_WORKFLOW_BACKEND_REQUEST.md
!docs/LECTURER_RESEARCH_WORKFLOW_COMPLETION_REPORT.md

